<body>

<h1>Huong dan Khoi dong &amp; Quan ly PTKD-ERP</h1>

<p><b>Du an:</b> PTKD-ERP &nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Ngay tao:</b> 07/08/2026 &nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Nguoi tao:</b> Phong CNTT INDEVCO</p>

<div class="important">
<b>Thu muc du an:</b> <code>C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP</code><br>
<b>Cac file script nam tai:</b> <code>C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\start-server.ps1</code>, <code>stop-server.ps1</code>, <code>watch-access.ps1</code><br>
Cac script da co san duong dan tuyet doi, co the chay tu bat ky thu muc nao.
</div>

<hr>

<div class="section">
<h2>1. Tong quan cac lenh</h2>

<table>
<tr><th>Lenh</th><th>Chuc nang</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\start-server.ps1</code></td><td>Khoi dong DB + Backend + Frontend, hien thi URL truy cap</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\stop-server.ps1</code></td><td>Dung tat ca dich vu</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\watch-access.ps1</code></td><td>Xem realtime IP nao dang truy cap web</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>2. Dia chi truy cap web (URL)</h2>

<div class="important">
Sau khi khoi dong, truy cap web PTKD-ERP bang mot trong cac dia chi sau:
</div>

<table>
<tr><th>Loai</th><th>Dia chi</th><th>Ghi chu</th></tr>
<tr><td>Tu may chu</td><td><code>http://localhost</code></td><td>Chi truy cap duoc tren chinh may cai dat</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tu may khac trong mang LAN</td><td><code>http://&lt;IP-may-chu&gt;</code></td><td>Thay &lt;IP-may-chu&gt; bang IP that cua may chu, vi du: <code>http://10.45.3.207</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Theo ten may</td><td><code>http://&lt;ten-may-chu&gt;</code></td><td>Vi du: <code>http://SERVER-PTKD</code> (neu DNS noi bo phan giai duoc)</td></tr>
</table>

<p><b>Cach xem IP may chu:</b></p>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">ipconfig</span>
<span style="color:#6a9955">REM Tim dong "IPv4 Address" trong ket qua</span>
</pre>

<p><b>Cong mac dinh:</b> 80 (khong can go port). Neu doi cong, vi du 8080, thi truy cap <code>http://&lt;IP&gt;:8080</code></p>

<div class="note">
<b>Luu y:</b> Khi chay <code>start-server.ps1</code>, chuong trinh se tu dong hien thi tat ca dia chi IP co the truy cap. Chi can copy link do gui cho nguoi dung.
</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>3. Khoi dong dich vu</h2>

<h3>3.1. Khoi dong binh thuong</h3>
<p>Mo PowerShell va chay:</p>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\start-server.ps1</span>
</pre>
<p>Hoac neu da o trong thu muc du an:</p>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">cd C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP</span>
<span class="cmd">.\start-server.ps1</span>
</pre>

<p>Lenh se thuc hien:</p>
<ol>
<li>Build Docker images (dung cache)</li>
<li>Khoi dong 3 container: <code>db</code> (SQL Server), <code>backend</code> (API), <code>frontend</code> (Web)</li>
<li>Kiem tra trang thai (running/healthy)</li>
<li><b>Hien thi danh sach URL truy cap</b> (localhost + IP mang LAN + hostname)</li>
</ol>

<h3>3.2. Khoi dong voi rebuild (sau khi sua code)</h3>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\start-server.ps1</span> <span class="flag">-Rebuild</span>
</pre>
<p>Build lai image tu dau, khong dung cache. <b>Bat buoc</b> khi thay doi code frontend/backend.</p>

<h3>3.3. Khoi dong voi migration (cap nhat database)</h3>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\start-server.ps1</span> <span class="flag">-Migrate</span>
</pre>

<h3>3.4. Ket hop ca hai</h3>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\start-server.ps1</span> <span class="flag">-Rebuild</span> <span class="flag">-Migrate</span>
</pre>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>4. Dung dich vu</h2>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\stop-server.ps1</span>
</pre>
<p>Dung tat ca container. Du lieu database van duoc giu trong Docker volume.</p>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>5. Xem log truy cap (IP, ten may tinh)</h2>

<h3>5.1. Xem realtime tat ca request</h3>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\watch-access.ps1</span>
</pre>
<p>Hien thi theo thoi gian thuc:</p>
<ul>
<li><b>Dia chi IP</b> cua may dang truy cap</li>
<li>Thoi gian truy cap</li>
<li>Phuong thuc (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE)</li>
<li>Duong dan trang truy cap</li>
<li>Ma trang thai (200 = OK, 404 = khong tim thay, 500 = loi)</li>
</ul>
<p>Nhan <code>Ctrl+C</code> de dung xem.</p>

<h3>5.2. Chi xem API request (bo qua file tinh)</h3>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\watch-access.ps1</span> <span class="flag">-ApiOnly</span>
</pre>

<h3>5.3. Tong hop theo IP + ten may tinh</h3>
<pre>
<span class="cmd">C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP\watch-access.ps1</span> <span class="flag">-Summary</span>
</pre>
<p>Hien thi bang tong hop:</p>
<table>
<tr><th>IP</th><th>So request</th><th>Hostname (ten may)</th></tr>
<tr><td>10.45.3.100</td><td>142</td><td>PC-KINHDO01</td></tr>
<tr><td>10.45.3.105</td><td>89</td><td>PC-KETOAN03</td></tr>
<tr><td>192.168.1.50</td><td>23</td><td>LAPTOP-GIAMDOC</td></tr>
</table>
<p><i>(Vi du minh hoa)</i></p>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>6. Cac lenh Docker bo sung</h2>

<p>Chay tu thu muc <code>C:\Projects\PTKD-ERP</code>:</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Lenh</th><th>Chuc nang</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>docker compose ps</code></td><td>Xem trang thai cac container</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>docker compose logs -f</code></td><td>Xem log tat ca dich vu</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>docker compose logs -f backend</code></td><td>Xem log chi backend</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>docker compose restart backend</code></td><td>Khoi dong lai backend</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>docker compose restart frontend</code></td><td>Khoi dong lai frontend</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>7. Luu y</h2>

<div class="note">
<b>Lan dau tien</b> hoac sau khi cap nhat code, chay <code>start-server.ps1 -Rebuild</code> de build lai image.
</div>

<div class="note">
<b>Yeu cau may chu:</b> Can cai dat Docker Desktop va PowerShell 5.1+.
</div>

<div class="note">
<b>Cong mac dinh:</b> Frontend chay tren cong 80. Doi bang bien moi truong <code>$env:FRONTEND_PORT = '8080'</code> truoc khi chay start-server.
</div>

<div class="note">
<b>Tuong lua (Firewall):</b> Neu may khac trong mang LAN khong truy cap duoc, kiem tra Windows Firewall da mo cong 80 (hoac cong da cau hinh) cho Inbound TCP.
</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
